+# Finding 21 — The quickstart recommendation is good; its benchmark claim is not
+
+**Verdict: SOUND**
+
+## Evidence
+
+The exact task currently crosses CLI, plugin, agent, Pi, and HTTP documentation.
+
+The CLI README does not publish the full create/prompt/state happy path.
